    "result_text": "All 268 tests pass. \n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the registration-date default for owner creation:\n\n- **`Owner` entity** (`model/Owner.java`): added a `LocalDate registrationDate` field mapped to a new `registration_date` column, with getter/setter.\n- **DB schemas** (`db/{hsqldb,h2,mysql,postgres}/schema.sql`): added a nullable `registration_date DATE` column to the `owners` table.\n- **Seed data** (`db/hsqldb/data.sql`): the positional `INSERT INTO owners VALUES (...)` statements needed the extra column value appended (`NULL`), since they don't list columns. The other dialects already list columns explicitly.\n- **OpenAPI** (`openapi.yml`): added `registrationDate` (`type: string, format: date`) to `OwnerFields`, which flows into both the request DTO and the `Owner` response DTO via `allOf`. The generator maps it to `java.time.LocalDate`, serialized by Jackson as ISO `YYYY-MM-DD`.\n- **`BuildOwner`** function: after mapping the request, if `registrationDate` is absent it defaults to `LocalDate.now()`.\n\nMapStruct auto-maps the field in both directions (no strict unmapped-target policy configured). The `Cp08Tests` acceptance test (`registrationDate` defaults to today) and the full suite (268 tests) are green.",
